---
export const prerender = true;
import AppShell from "../components/ui/AppShell.astro";
const SITE = "https://www.relifish.store";
---
<AppShell
  title="About Relifish — Mumbai's Fresh Fish Marketplace"
  description="Relifish connects Mumbai fish buyers directly to local sellers. No middleman, no cold storage, no platform markup. Order same-day morning-fresh catch or pre-order tomorrow's catch from Tardeo, Kandivali, Thane, and Kamothe."
  nav={{ active: "home" }}
  jsonLd={{
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@graph": [
      {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "@id": `${SITE}/#org`,
        "name": "Relifish",
        "url": SITE,
        "logo": { "@type": "ImageObject", "url": `${SITE}/icon-192.svg` },
        "foundingDate": "2025",
        "description": "Mumbai's fresh fish marketplace — cutting out middlemen so buyers pay less and sellers earn more.",
        "areaServed": { "@type": "City", "name": "Mumbai" },
        "contactPoint": { "@type": "ContactPoint", "contactType": "customer service", "email": "relifishstore@gmail.com" },
        "sameAs": []
      },
      {
        "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
        "itemListElement": [
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": SITE },
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "About", "item": `${SITE}/about` }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }}
>
  <article style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 16px 64px;font-family:var(--v2-font,Inter);color:var(--v2-ink);">

    <h1 style="font:800 28px/1.2 var(--v2-font,Inter);margin-bottom:8px;">About Relifish</h1>
    <p style="font:400 15px/1.6 var(--v2-font,Inter);color:var(--v2-ink-2);margin-bottom:32px;">Mumbai's direct fish marketplace</p>

    <section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
      <h2 style="font:700 18px/1.3 var(--v2-font,Inter);margin-bottom:12px;">The problem we're solving</h2>
      <p style="font:400 15px/1.7 var(--v2-font,Inter);color:var(--v2-ink-2);">
        When you order pomfret on Swiggy or Zomato, you pay ₹25–35% more than the seller's actual price.
        The aggregator takes a cut, adds surge pricing, and the fish may have spent 2–3 days in cold storage before it reaches you.
        Mumbai has incredible local fish sellers — Tardeo, Bhaucha Dhakka, Crawford Market — but they had no direct digital channel to reach buyers.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
      <h2 style="font:700 18px/1.3 var(--v2-font,Inter);margin-bottom:12px;">What Relifish does</h2>
      <p style="font:400 15px/1.7 var(--v2-font,Inter);color:var(--v2-ink-2);">
        Relifish is a direct marketplace for fresh fish in Mumbai. Buyers browse real seller menus, compare prices for surmai, pomfret, rawas, bangda, prawns, and 15+ other species — then pre-order before the seller's nightly cutoff (11 PM). The seller confirms after the morning catch. Fish reaches you within 24 hours of landing — no cold storage, no middleman markup.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
      <h2 style="font:700 18px/1.3 var(--v2-font,Inter);margin-bottom:12px;">Our sellers</h2>
      <p style="font:400 15px/1.7 var(--v2-font,Inter);color:var(--v2-ink-2);">We currently work with four vetted sellers across Mumbai:</p>
      <ul style="margin:12px 0 0 20px;font:400 15px/1.8 var(--v2-font,Inter);color:var(--v2-ink-2);">
        <li><strong>Bombay Sea Food</strong> — Tardeo · surmai, pomfret, prawns, salmon</li>
        <li><strong>Ocean Lover Fish</strong> — Kandivali · 17+ species</li>
        <li><strong>Fish Tokri</strong> — Thane · sliced fillets, prawns</li>
        <li><strong>The Fishy Spot</strong> — Kamothe · local catch daily</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
      <h2 style="font:700 18px/1.3 var(--v2-font,Inter);margin-bottom:12px;">For buyers</h2>
      <p style="font:400 15px/1.7 var(--v2-font,Inter);color:var(--v2-ink-2);">
        No app download needed. Open relifish.store on your phone, set your Mumbai location, browse seller menus, and order. Pre-orders close at 11 PM each night. Pickup or home delivery available depending on the seller.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
      <h2 style="font:700 18px/1.3 var(--v2-font,Inter);margin-bottom:12px;">For fish sellers in Mumbai</h2>
      <p style="font:400 15px/1.7 var(--v2-font,Inter);color:var(--v2-ink-2);">
        Join Relifish free. List your fish, set your prices, manage pre-orders from a mobile dashboard. No commission on sales. Relifish earns from premium seller features — not from taking a cut of every order.
      </p>
      <a href="/seller-detailed.html" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 20px;background:var(--v2-brand,#2563eb);color:#fff;border-radius:8px;font:600 14px var(--v2-font,Inter);text-decoration:none;">List your fish business →</a>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom:32px;">
      <h2 style="font:700 18px/1.3 var(--v2-font,Inter);margin-bottom:12px;">Contact</h2>
      <p style="font:400 15px/1.7 var(--v2-font,Inter);color:var(--v2-ink-2);">
        Email: <a href="mailto:relifishstore@gmail.com" style="color:var(--v2-brand,#2563eb);">relifishstore@gmail.com</a><br />
        Based in Mumbai, Maharashtra, India.
      </p>
    </section>

  </article>
</AppShell>
